WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.182
Today was Wellness Day at school.

2
00:00:05.183 --> 00:00:09.672
Emmy's class went for a walk outside.

3
00:00:09.673 --> 00:00:13.734
Miss Hamm stopped near some trees.

4
00:00:13.735 --> 00:00:17.885
"Let's do yoga!" she said.

5
00:00:17.886 --> 00:00:21.991
Emmy watched Miss Hamm stretch.

6
00:00:21.992 --> 00:00:26.177
"Raise your arms, everyone," Miss Hamm said.

7
00:00:26.178 --> 00:00:29.956
"And reach for the sun."

8
00:00:29.957 --> 00:00:34.483
Everyone stretched their arms.

9
00:00:34.484 --> 00:00:39.719
"Now let's meditate," Miss Hamm said.

10
00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:42.994
Everyone sat down.

11
00:00:42.995 --> 00:00:46.619
"Relax," Miss Hamm said.

12
00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:52.490
"And take deep breaths."

13
00:00:52.491 --> 00:00:55.385
Miss Hamm smiled.

14
00:00:55.386 --> 00:00:59.815
"Life can be stressful," she said.

15
00:00:59.816 --> 00:01:04.988
"Meditation helps you feel calm."

16
00:01:04.989 --> 00:01:12.152
Emmy took a deep breath and smiled.

17
00:01:12.153 --> 00:01:15.735
At home Emmy wanted to help her family.

18
00:01:15.736 --> 00:01:19.136
Harry was working on homework.

19
00:01:19.137 --> 00:01:22.878
"Homework is stressful," she thought.

20
00:01:22.879 --> 00:01:25.611
"Harry," Emmy said.

21
00:01:25.612 --> 00:01:28.296
"Is that homework hard?"

22
00:01:28.297 --> 00:01:34.378
Harry smiled. "No, I'm almost done!"

23
00:01:34.379 --> 00:01:40.227
Emmy frowned. "Hmm."

24
00:01:40.228 --> 00:01:43.491
Oliver was making his bed.

25
00:01:43.492 --> 00:01:47.037
"That looks hard," Emmy said.

26
00:01:47.038 --> 00:01:49.632
"Is it stressful?"

27
00:01:49.633 --> 00:01:57.802
Oliver laughed. "No, it's fun!"

28
00:01:57.803 --> 00:02:01.208
Dad was organizing the garage.

29
00:02:01.209 --> 00:02:04.319
A box fell off a shelf.

30
00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:07.556
Old toys spilled out.

31
00:02:07.557 --> 00:02:12.870
"Ugh!" Dad said.

32
00:02:12.871 --> 00:02:17.686
"Dad, let's meditate," Emmy said.

33
00:02:17.687 --> 00:02:20.812
"Not right now, Emmy," Dad said.

34
00:02:20.813 --> 00:02:25.776
"I need to clean up this mess."

35
00:02:25.777 --> 00:02:29.140
Emmy went into the backyard.

36
00:02:29.141 --> 00:02:32.181
"Grr!" She stomped her foot.

37
00:02:32.182 --> 00:02:35.371
"Nobody wants help!"

38
00:02:35.372 --> 00:02:40.357
Suddenly Emmy got an idea.

39
00:02:40.358 --> 00:02:43.091
She sat down.

40
00:02:43.092 --> 00:02:47.594
"Relax," she told herself.

41
00:02:47.595 --> 00:02:52.710
"Take deep breaths."

42
00:02:52.711 --> 00:02:58.814
Soon she felt calm!

